        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meyow</strong> is a fast-paced survival arena game where you play as a spinning, gun-wielding cat fighting off endless waves of zombies. Dodge, rotate, shoot, and stay alive as long as you can while chaos unfolds around you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Spinning Cat Combat</strong><br>Control Meyow, a constantly rotating cat armed with a rifle. Position yourself, time your shots, and keep moving to survive the swarming undead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Endless Zombie Waves</strong><br>Different types of zombies approach from every direction. Some are fast, some are tough, and some are just unsettlingly well-dressed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Disco Ultimate Ability</strong><br>Fill your ultimate bar to unleash a full-screen disco blast that lights up the battlefield and wipes out everything around you. Bright colors, flashing lights, total destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Score-Based Survival</strong><br>Every second matters. Every zombie defeated increases your score. Compete with yourself to beat your best runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Simple, Addictive Gameplay</strong><br>No complex menus or long tutorials. Jump in, spin, shoot, and enjoy short, intense play sessions.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meyow</strong> is a fast-paced survival arena game where you play as a spinning, gun-wielding cat fighting off endless waves of zombies. Dodge, rotate, shoot, and stay alive as long as you can while chaos unfolds around you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Spinning Cat Combat</strong><br>Control Meyow, a constantly rotating cat armed with a rifle. Position yourself, time your shots, and keep moving to survive the swarming undead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Endless Zombie Waves</strong><br>Different types of zombies approach from every direction. Some are fast, some are tough, and some are just unsettlingly well-dressed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Disco Ultimate Ability</strong><br>Fill your ultimate bar to unleash a full-screen disco blast that lights up the battlefield and wipes out everything around you. Bright colors, flashing lights, total destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Score-Based Survival</strong><br>Every second matters. Every zombie defeated increases your score. Compete with yourself to beat your best runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Simple, Addictive Gameplay</strong><br>No complex menus or long tutorials. Jump in, spin, shoot, and enjoy short, intense play sessions.</p>",
        "short_description": "Meyow is a fast-paced survival arena game where you play as a spinning, gun-wielding cat fighting off endless waves of zombies. Dodge, rotate, shoot, and stay alive as long as you can while chaos unfolds around you.",
